Transitive dependencies
-----------------------

`@modelcontextprotocol/sdk` pulls in further npm packages (for example
express, hono, and ajv), so the full set of code installed with the MCP
server is larger than the four entries above. This notice lists the works
that the three shipped packages declare directly as runtime dependencies.
For the authoritative, complete set — every package installed, with its
version and the license each declares — read `package-lock.json` and the
`LICENSE` file inside each installed package folder; do not treat the list
above as exhaustive of everything the package manager installs.

Not distributed; fetched or installed by the user
-------------------------------------------------

- playwright-core 1.64.1 (Apache-2.0) is a devDependency of
  `@seaworthy/verify` and is loaded lazily and optionally at runtime for
  rendered checks (`packages/verify/src/render.ts`); it is absent from the
